<title>USA: New York timecharter fixtures - Dec 11.</title>
<headline>New York timecharter fixtures - Dec 11.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bestore Due (built 1985) 68,000 dwt del USG early Jan t/c trip Far East $14,500 daily plus $285,000 bonus HMM (ammends vessel name, size).</p>
<p>Beauty Sea (built 1991) 69,365 dwt del Antwerp redel Atlantic 15-20/12 $12,500 daily cnr.</p>
<p>Prabhu Parvati (built 1983) 41,427 dwt 22-27/12 del Skaw redel Singapore/Japan $11,300 daily A.P.Moller.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
